MCPclient -> AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.McpServer <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : 1: Submit bounded tools/call\n<size:14>[MCP2025-11-25 Streamable HTTP over authenticated loopback TCP/owner adb forward]</size>
AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.McpServer -> AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.ClientAuthenticator <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : 2: Authenticate session owner
AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.McpServer -> AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.InvocationPlanner <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : 3: Plan exact binding, arguments and backend scope
AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.McpServer -> AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.AdmissionGate <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : 4: Check per-client grant, Ask consent, OS/backend authority and current epochs
AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.AdmissionGate -> AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.ComposemanagementUI <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : 5: Ask branch: local exact review within original deadline; deny/timeout means no dispatch
Localowner -> AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.ComposemanagementUI <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : 6: Ask branch: approve exact local challenge or deny within original deadline
AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.ComposemanagementUI -> AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.AdmissionGate <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : 7: Approve exact challenge or return structured denial; continue only if approved
AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.AdmissionGate -> AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.DeviceViewResolver <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : 8: Pin compatible binding and coherent types
AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.AdmissionGate -> AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.CatalogRepository <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : 9: Recheck current document and contract pins
AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.AdmissionGate -> AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.AuditLogger <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : 10: Fail-closed mandatory admission audit before dispatch
AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.AdmissionGate -> AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.McpServer <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : 11: Return exact Admission and policy/contract pins
AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.McpServer -> AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.InvocationPlanner <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : 12: Dispatch Admission once; no replay of uncertain effects
AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.InvocationPlanner -> AndroidOSandtargetapps <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : 13: Invoke permitted backend
AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.InvocationPlanner -> AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.AuditLogger <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : 14: Record admitted dispatch and observed/unknown outcome
AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.InvocationPlanner -> AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.McpServer <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : 15: Return bounded invocation result or structured denial/unknown outcome
AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.McpServer -> MCPclient <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : 16: Return single final JSON-RPC result/error; POST SSE normally terminates\n<size:14>[MCP2025-11-25]</size>

